"--The one who overcame the 'Dragon's Blood' bathed upon his body and became an immortal knight, a member of the 'Sword Saint' lineage. I wish to appoint Heinkel Astrea-sama as my knight."

Yes, Philore, having become the sixth Royal Selection candidate, boldly declared that Heinkel Astrea, the 'Sword-Bearer,' was the most suitable person to be the First Knight for herself, the sixth candidate.
